# AWS Configuration – My Cloud Support Lab

## 1. Project Overview

**Project:** My Cloud Support Lab – EC2 Web Hosting, S3 Backup Integration, and CloudWatch Monitoring

This project deploys a responsive static website on an Amazon EC2 instance, configures VPC networking and security, grants the EC2 instance scoped access to Amazon S3 through an IAM role, and monitors EC2 CPU utilization with Amazon CloudWatch and Amazon SNS notifications.

